index 0000000..58eab18
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/8365.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+`tmpdir`, `tmpdir_factory` and `tmp_path_factory` now fall back to a generic
+``unknown`` user name if the current user name contains characters which are not
+valid in a path component, fixing a crash when creating the base temporary
+directory (e.g. when the user name is a Windows domain user such as
+``domain\user``).
